WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:17.517
<i>I had only one dream since childhood.</i>

2
00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:40.123
{\an8}KO GYOM, NINE YEARS OLD

3
00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.625
<i>Rewatch all-all movies.</i>

4
00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:50.091
{\an8}PARK OF THE JURASSIC PERIOD

5
00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:58.767
<i>And I had perfect conditions,</i>
<i>to make this dream come true.</i>

6
00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:11.196
Hello!

7
00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.324
Others already rewatched?

8
00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:15.825
Yes.

9
00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:19.412
You are not bored
watch movies all day by yourself?

10
00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.581
I adore it.

11
00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:30.840
sir

12
00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.843
Sir!

13
00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.099
- This, please.
- For God's sake.

14
00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:41.976
There was no need to wake me up.
Let him see for himself!

15
00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.770
God is merciful.

16
00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:46.147
- Are you at work?
- Yes.

17
00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:53.404
Here is the rent for the month.

18
00:01:54.197 --> 00:01:55.365
Sorry to be late.

19
00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:58.952
Do not overwork. You are kind of tired.

20
00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:01.329
- Take care of your health.
- Okay.

21
00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:02.747
Don't worry about him.

22
00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:05.750
I haven't seen yet
so that the child has so much fun by himself.

23
00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.796
<i>Because living in a video rental store -</i>

24
00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:12.048
<i>it's like living in paradise.</i>

25
00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:16.469
Goem, I'm coming.

26
00:02:24.018 --> 00:02:25.979
<i>And that's all I needed.</i>

27
00:02:30.942 --> 00:02:31.985
Gomm!

28
00:02:32.068 --> 00:02:34.237
Only those with green stickers!

29
00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.240
Grow out of diapers first, little one.

30
00:02:42.453 --> 00:02:44.831
Such What time is it now?

31
00:02:54.591 --> 00:02:59.762
<i>And soon</i>
<i>I've already watched everything I wanted to.</i>

32
00:03:06.144 --> 00:03:07.812
- And what are you doing?
- God!

33
00:03:09.397 --> 00:03:11.524
Just decided to help.

34
00:03:11.608 --> 00:03:15.612
They took the tape to watch
and the box was not turned over so that others would know.

35
00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:18.323
What is there?

36
00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:24.370
You said it was empty!
Don't even think about it, young man.

37
00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.665
- I will go.
- Good.

38
00:03:27.749 --> 00:03:30.919
And watch less movies, or you'll go blind.

39
00:03:31.502 --> 00:03:32.837
- Be there.
- And one more thing.

40
00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:35.173
I advise you to watch the one nearby.

41
00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:37.217
Good luck, boss!

42
00:03:42.263 --> 00:03:46.976
<i>But around that time</i>
<i>I have a new problem.</i>

43
00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:50.230
From now on I will not speak to those
who has not seen this.

44
00:03:50.313 --> 00:03:52.482
What is it? Something erotic?

45
00:03:53.775 --> 00:03:55.443
Don't you know Tarantino?

46
00:03:55.526 --> 00:03:58.071
Watch the first five minutes and you will understand.

47
00:03:58.154 --> 00:03:59.656
Dude made a cool movie.

48
00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:03.368
Why do you watch movies all the time?
Do you want your video rental?

49
00:04:03.952 --> 00:04:05.411
Think of yourself, Xi Chun.

50
00:04:05.495 --> 00:04:08.790
He will invent something
how many movies has he watched?

51
00:04:08.873 --> 00:04:11.376
What to think here? Geniuses don't care.

52
00:04:12.001 --> 00:04:13.670
- Are you a genius now?
- Yes.

53
00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:15.713
- So I shouldn't worry?
- Of course.

54
00:04:16.673 --> 00:04:19.676
- No, you should.
- I love and respect cinema very much.

55
00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:21.594
If I become the owner of the rental,

56
00:04:23.179 --> 00:04:24.722
it will be a loss for the film industry.

57
00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:29.185
<i>This was the beginning of my great thoughts.</i>

58
00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:32.355
Perhaps something should be done about it.

59
00:04:33.231 --> 00:04:34.065
Of course.

60
00:04:35.149 --> 00:04:37.193
Remember the 10,000 hour rule.

61
00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:41.864
You wasted so much time on movies
then let there be at least some benefit.

62
00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:44.659
OK.

63
00:04:44.742 --> 00:04:48.413
I think about my future.
Don't disturb me.

64
00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:53.042
- And I will direct the film.
- Good.

65
00:04:57.755 --> 00:05:00.591
{\an8}MAD DOGS

66
00:05:02.593 --> 00:05:06.139
<i>That day I began to think,</i>
<i>the screen saver just appeared.</i>

67
00:05:08.224 --> 00:05:11.644
<i>And before the credits rolled, I already knew the answer.</i>

68
00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:15.648
Yes, that's what I'll do.

69
00:05:17.233 --> 00:05:19.110
Friends, look at me.

70
00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:23.656
isn't it obvious
how should I join the film industry?

71
00:05:26.326 --> 00:05:29.370
Tough question, Goem. And how?

72
00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.666
He has a strange expression on his face.
Kind of unpleasant.

73
00:05:39.422 --> 00:05:40.423
Bam!

74
00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:41.424
<i>And that's why</i>

75
00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:45.136
<i>I'm here.</i>

76
00:05:46.888 --> 00:05:47.722
I had…

77
00:05:47.805 --> 00:05:48.973
{\an8}KO GYOM, TWENTY SIX

78
00:05:49.057 --> 00:05:51.684
...become an actor.

79
00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:54.604
{\an8}"WEALTH AND PROSPERITY"

80
00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:56.939
Anyway I love this.

81
00:05:57.023 --> 00:06:01.152
So he has a story. What did I ask?

82
00:06:01.235 --> 00:06:03.154
You haven't asked anything yet.

83
00:06:03.237 --> 00:06:04.822
Yes? Of course.

84
00:06:05.406 --> 00:06:09.118
So you are 26 years old.
Have you recently graduated from university?

85
00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:12.330
No. I finished school.
I did not study at university.

86
00:06:12.413 --> 00:06:13.331
what were you doing

87
00:06:13.414 --> 00:06:15.541
Earned money.

88
00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:19.253
Sun Sik was closing the video rental store,
i needed money

89
00:06:19.337 --> 00:06:20.505
Did you buy a shop?

90
00:06:20.588 --> 00:06:22.590
No, I bought video tapes.

91
00:06:23.674 --> 00:06:25.009
You are an interesting guy.

92
00:06:25.885 --> 00:06:28.805
I bought five of your movies
for 20,000 won.

93
00:06:31.349 --> 00:06:33.518
I like it. Very.

94
00:06:33.601 --> 00:06:36.687
I love when someone knows where
some crazy people come.

95
00:06:36.771 --> 00:06:39.190
Such people are mostly geniuses.

96
00:06:40.525 --> 00:06:42.777
You played a lot of episodic roles.
What kind of actor are you?

97
00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.695
Decent.

98
00:06:44.779 --> 00:06:47.448
show me I'm ready

99
00:06:48.533 --> 00:06:51.369
A minute I will get into the role.

100
00:07:18.771 --> 00:07:19.605
And that's all.

101
00:07:21.691 --> 00:07:22.775
What?

102
00:07:24.318 --> 00:07:25.361
should i go

103
00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:28.281
What?

104
00:07:29.198 --> 00:07:30.950
Of course, yes. Get up.

105
00:07:32.493 --> 00:07:34.996
Will you let me know?

106
00:07:35.079 --> 00:07:35.913
Of course.

107
00:07:35.997 --> 00:07:37.248
Thank you for taking the time.

108
00:07:37.331 --> 00:07:38.833
Yes, go.

109
00:07:47.592 --> 00:07:50.553
<i>Do you know that instinctive feeling?</i>

110
00:07:54.849 --> 00:07:58.227
<i>That day I had this feeling...</i>

111
00:08:08.362 --> 00:08:09.822
Mubi, you have come.

112
00:08:18.873 --> 00:08:20.708
<i>…when I heard that name.</i>

113
00:09:07.088 --> 00:09:10.216
<i>I had only one wish since childhood.</i>

114
00:09:10.299 --> 00:09:11.801
<i>Who is Kim Mubi?</i>

115
00:09:13.553 --> 00:09:15.805
<i>I wanted to change my stupid name.</i>

116
00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:18.099
KIM MUBY, NINE YEARS OLD

117
00:09:19.809 --> 00:09:20.643
is that you

118
00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:23.354
It won't work like that. where are your parents

119
00:09:23.437 --> 00:09:24.897
I want to talk to them.

120
00:09:24.981 --> 00:09:26.774
- I don't have them.
- What?

121
00:09:27.817 --> 00:09:29.151
Don't you have parents?

122
00:09:29.235 --> 00:09:30.695
They died.

123
00:09:31.237 --> 00:09:33.447
What… Really?

124
00:09:34.031 --> 00:09:35.074
Both?

125
00:09:35.157 --> 00:09:36.367
Yes.

126
00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.451
My God.

127
00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:40.204
Excuse me.

128
00:09:40.288 --> 00:09:41.205
And who are you?

129
00:09:41.289 --> 00:09:43.291
Her dad

130
00:09:45.334 --> 00:09:46.210
Stepfather.

131
00:09:46.794 --> 00:09:48.045
Biological dad.

132
00:09:49.505 --> 00:09:52.258
Excuse me. She is special, you see.

133
00:09:52.842 --> 00:09:56.262
<i>Because this name is not for me.</i>

134
00:09:56.971 --> 00:09:59.724
Sunny, you can't
ignore me forever

135
00:09:59.807 --> 00:10:00.933
{\an8}STUDIO TRANSPORT

136
00:10:01.017 --> 00:10:03.436
This time I will be gone for a long time.

137
00:10:04.687 --> 00:10:07.189
Where shall we go?
To the amusement park, as agreed?

138
00:10:18.075 --> 00:10:18.951
Yes, director.

139
00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:20.953
No, everything is fine.

140
00:10:21.537 --> 00:10:22.371
Yes.

141
00:10:25.291 --> 00:10:26.792
Yes, I will come.

142
00:10:27.668 --> 00:10:28.878
OK. Be there.

143
00:10:33.966 --> 00:10:35.176
Mubi.

144
00:10:35.259 --> 00:10:37.553
When I'm done with this movie

145
00:10:37.637 --> 00:10:40.431
I promise, I will be with you every day.

146
00:10:41.057 --> 00:10:44.226
This movie will be followed by another one.

147
00:10:45.061 --> 00:10:47.897
And then another.

148
00:10:49.398 --> 00:10:51.150
You only think about movies.

149
00:10:53.778 --> 00:10:54.654
This is not true.

150
00:10:55.404 --> 00:10:57.490
I will shoot my movie.

151
00:10:58.366 --> 00:11:02.495
I will be able to manage my own schedule
and spend more time with you.

152
00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.791
I promise, do you hear me?

153
00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:16.384
<i>I always competed with my name.</i>

154
00:11:22.431 --> 00:11:25.976
<i>And the way I intended</i>
<i>win these competitions…</i>

155
00:11:26.519 --> 00:11:28.771
Did you make fun of him?

156
00:11:28.854 --> 00:11:30.356
Yes, so what?

157
00:11:31.482 --> 00:11:33.150
- Run away.
- Come back!

158
00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:34.151
This is Kim Mubi!

159
00:11:34.235 --> 00:11:35.736
<i>…was quite simple.</i>

160
00:11:36.529 --> 00:11:40.199
{\an8}TEACHER

161
00:11:47.289 --> 00:11:52.503
<i>Let's call it a child's rebellion,</i>
<i>who desperately needed attention.</i>

162
00:11:57.091 --> 00:12:01.971
Mubi why are you cheating
that your dad died

163
00:12:02.054 --> 00:12:05.474
I'm not cheating. He is almost dead.

164
00:12:09.353 --> 00:12:10.896
<i>Then I had no idea...</i>

165
00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:26.579
DAD

166
00:12:29.582 --> 00:12:33.002
<i>…that this is a conflicting feeling</i>
<i>will be with me for a long time.</i>

167
00:12:35.254 --> 00:12:36.255
<i>Besides,</i>

168
00:12:37.256 --> 00:12:39.717
<i>I never wanted this to happen.</i>

169
00:12:42.511 --> 00:12:44.472
- My condolences.
- I sympathize.

170
00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.279
I'm Kim Sang Guk from Geon Media.

171
00:13:00.988 --> 00:13:04.408
If you want to share stories…

172
00:13:06.619 --> 00:13:10.873
<i>I thought that once</i>
<i>win this children's competition.</i>

173
00:13:30.893 --> 00:13:34.230
<i>Maybe I had no right to compete at all.</i>

174
00:13:48.077 --> 00:13:50.621
{\an8}FOUR-LEAF CLOVER
KIM HOON TON

175
00:13:54.333 --> 00:13:57.503
<i>Then I saw it for the first time.</i>

176
00:14:04.677 --> 00:14:06.011
<i>Dad.</i>

177
00:14:06.762 --> 00:14:07.847
<i>Daddy!</i>

178
00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:11.016
<i>I saw what I had been struggling with for so long.</i>

179
00:14:14.854 --> 00:14:16.772
<i>The movie I watched then...</i>

180
00:14:21.235 --> 00:14:25.614
<i>was the most boring of all.</i>

181
00:14:29.159 --> 00:14:32.413
<i>That's why I'm here.</i>

182
00:14:33.205 --> 00:14:39.670
{\an8}KIM MUBY, TWENTY SIX YEARS OLD

183
00:14:40.254 --> 00:14:41.171
hello

184
00:14:41.922 --> 00:14:45.217
Yes, I have them. I'm already leaving. OK.

185
00:14:47.177 --> 00:14:49.972
<i>That's not what I'm here for</i>
<i>to dedicate a film to him</i>

186
00:14:50.055 --> 00:14:52.641
<i>or to take revenge for him.</i>

187
00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:55.019
<i>Nothing so ambitious.</i>

188
00:15:00.274 --> 00:15:05.154
<i>I wanted to show him how pathetic</i>
<i>dedicate your life to a terrible movie.</i>

189
00:15:18.709 --> 00:15:20.002
Mubi, you have come.

190
00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:44.234
What a beautiful name.

191
00:15:56.664 --> 00:16:02.252
LIKE IN THE MOVIE

192
00:16:02.836 --> 00:16:09.802
EPISODE 1
IT WILL BE PICTURESQUE AT DAWN

193
00:16:11.679 --> 00:16:14.181
{\an8}VIDEO BAR

194
00:16:20.771 --> 00:16:21.814
Dear

195
00:16:22.481 --> 00:16:26.652
Can you move a little faster?

196
00:16:27.528 --> 00:16:29.488
At this rate, we will never open!

197
00:16:29.571 --> 00:16:31.657
All the same, there will be no customers soon.

198
00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:34.034
Ah, you scumbag. Don't you dare fool me.

199
00:16:34.118 --> 00:16:34.952
Listen.

200
00:16:35.911 --> 00:16:38.414
And if the client comes in just now?

201
00:16:39.123 --> 00:16:41.625
If someone comes in right now...

202
00:16:44.586 --> 00:16:46.213
Haven't you opened yet?

203
00:16:46.964 --> 00:16:48.590
My God. you again

204
00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:51.635
Eat first. I brought you food.

205
00:16:51.719 --> 00:16:54.972
Your mother packed so much again.

206
00:16:55.472 --> 00:16:57.224
Thank her for me.

207
00:16:57.307 --> 00:16:58.142
Necessarily.

208
00:17:00.436 --> 00:17:01.854
You just look.

209
00:17:04.064 --> 00:17:05.649
Few customers?

210
00:17:05.733 --> 00:17:07.317
Yes, no one is coming.

211
00:17:08.235 --> 00:17:11.405
Get rid of this junk.
The place seems outdated.

212
00:17:11.488 --> 00:17:12.573
Obsolete?

213
00:17:13.407 --> 00:17:16.994
To the scoundrel, the only thing that is outdated here is -
it's your rotten brain.

214
00:17:17.077 --> 00:17:19.163
- This?
- They will agree.

215
00:17:22.124 --> 00:17:23.042
Take your time.

216
00:17:23.792 --> 00:17:26.795
This is a side dish. I'll leave it with you in the studio.

217
00:17:26.879 --> 00:17:27.963
Good.

218
00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:31.759
Just look at yourself
stuffed his mouth full.

219
00:17:31.842 --> 00:17:32.843
Listen, Chu A.

220
00:17:32.926 --> 00:17:36.180
You spoil him too much.

221
00:17:36.263 --> 00:17:38.265
You and your husband are dating
are you raising a child?

222
00:17:39.141 --> 00:17:41.268
- You see.
- Be careful!

223
00:17:41.351 --> 00:17:45.856
Why did you leave if you are starving?

224
00:17:46.356 --> 00:17:48.901
Why waste youth like that?

225
00:17:48.984 --> 00:17:51.820
Honci will take up music more seriously.

226
00:17:51.904 --> 00:17:53.030
Support him.

227
00:17:53.113 --> 00:17:55.783
Drop out of university to pursue music?

228
00:17:55.866 --> 00:17:57.284
You are an ungrateful fool.

229
00:17:57.951 --> 00:17:59.870
I advise you to get his autograph now.

230
00:17:59.953 --> 00:18:02.873
Honsey will become a super famous songwriter.

231
00:18:02.956 --> 00:18:04.291
He works hard.

232
00:18:04.374 --> 00:18:08.003
It's not that difficult. I go with the flow.

233
00:18:08.837 --> 00:18:11.423
I am more talented than hardworking.

234
00:18:12.132 --> 00:18:15.344
How self-confident.
I would shoot you even now.

235
00:18:15.427 --> 00:18:16.512
Chu A.

236
00:18:16.595 --> 00:18:19.389
Dump this loser.

237
00:18:19.473 --> 00:18:22.684
Even if you live a decent life.

238
00:18:22.768 --> 00:18:25.938
Find a decent job
and forget about this balamut.

239
00:18:26.021 --> 00:18:27.106
Seriously!

240
00:18:27.981 --> 00:18:30.359
I already said, I won't be working here for long.

241
00:18:31.235 --> 00:18:32.069
Not long.

242
00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:35.823
And don't call me a loser.
You are not better.

243
00:18:37.783 --> 00:18:42.287
Actually, I thought so too
follow your dream like Xi Chun.

244
00:18:42.371 --> 00:18:47.126
God is merciful. That damn loser
spoiled a normal child.

245
00:18:49.795 --> 00:18:50.629
Come what may,

246
00:18:51.713 --> 00:18:55.467
where did the third one go?
from your crazy three?

247
00:19:13.318 --> 00:19:17.906
<i>As everyone expected, I became an actor.</i>

248
00:19:29.668 --> 00:19:31.336
The enemy is always lurking.

249
00:19:31.837 --> 00:19:35.591
You never know who is in front of you.

250
00:19:36.466 --> 00:19:38.760
I knew I would be stabbed in the back.

251
00:19:43.515 --> 00:19:46.768
- What is he doing?
- I waited too long.

252
00:19:52.733 --> 00:19:54.443
What does he do? Director!

253
00:19:54.526 --> 00:19:55.360
Removed!

254
00:19:56.236 --> 00:19:58.572
Ahoy! Go Goem!

255
00:20:03.202 --> 00:20:05.537
- Take him away.
- I just got used to the role.

256
00:20:06.038 --> 00:20:10.876
