This way, Goem. sit here

519
00:39:24.904 --> 00:39:28.240
- Do you have no scenes today?
- No.

520
00:39:29.075 --> 00:39:31.494
- Then you will help us.
- Of course.

521
00:39:34.622 --> 00:39:37.458
Wait a minute, am I upset?

522
00:40:15.413 --> 00:40:17.873
I do not advise you to do this.

523
00:40:17.957 --> 00:40:19.583
You talk like a thug.

524
00:41:00.040 --> 00:41:01.500
- Good afternoon.
- Kind.

525
00:41:01.584 --> 00:41:03.252
{\an8}FRESH CORN FROM THE FARM

526
00:41:03.836 --> 00:41:05.296
Corn for 20,000 won.

527
00:41:05.379 --> 00:41:07.631
- I will pay first.
- Of course.

528
00:41:07.715 --> 00:41:08.549
- Here.
- Okay.

529
00:41:11.302 --> 00:41:12.553
Thank you.

530
00:41:13.512 --> 00:41:16.390
hold on Eat while hot.

531
00:41:16.474 --> 00:41:18.684
OK. Good luck with the sale.

532
00:41:26.692 --> 00:41:28.068
This is my bus!

533
00:41:29.236 --> 00:41:30.279
Ahoy!

534
00:41:31.489 --> 00:41:34.575
Stand up!

535
00:41:44.627 --> 00:41:46.337
Wait for me! Please…

536
00:41:51.342 --> 00:41:52.301
And you too?

537
00:42:07.942 --> 00:42:13.072
{\an8}BUS STOP

538
00:42:13.155 --> 00:42:15.866
I heard the buses are here
stop driving early.

539
00:42:16.408 --> 00:42:17.826
It will be in 30 minutes.

540
00:42:17.910 --> 00:42:20.204
Yes. The world has become too convenient.

541
00:42:20.287 --> 00:42:21.455
Devil!

542
00:42:31.715 --> 00:42:35.219
I have a question. Are you always so weird?

543
00:42:37.012 --> 00:42:38.681
Are you always so happy?

544
00:42:39.515 --> 00:42:41.183
The world is more than what you see.

545
00:42:41.267 --> 00:42:42.851
Exactly bigger than a movie.

546
00:42:42.935 --> 00:42:45.813
You won't miss a single comment.
Are you a good fighter?

547
00:42:45.896 --> 00:42:46.814
Yes.

548
00:42:48.232 --> 00:42:49.149
I give up.

549
00:43:04.707 --> 00:43:07.167
What movie will you shoot?

550
00:43:16.468 --> 00:43:17.386
Beautiful…

551
00:43:21.724 --> 00:43:22.558
melodrama

552
00:43:26.645 --> 00:43:27.479
Melodrama?

553
00:43:36.155 --> 00:43:37.156
Are you laughing at me?

554
00:43:37.239 --> 00:43:40.117
No, I choked on food. Laugh at you? I?

555
00:43:40.701 --> 00:43:41.785
I wouldn't dare.

556
00:43:42.870 --> 00:43:46.457
And you? Are you still playing?

557
00:43:47.875 --> 00:43:50.878
i have to play

558
00:43:50.961 --> 00:43:53.797
that the film industry
did not lose a great talent.

559
00:43:58.052 --> 00:43:58.969
But...

560
00:44:01.972 --> 00:44:04.975
I love movies, that's all.

561
00:44:09.104 --> 00:44:09.938
What?

562
00:44:11.482 --> 00:44:13.359
I just love movies!

563
00:44:13.442 --> 00:44:14.860
I'm talking about movies, not you.

564
00:44:14.943 --> 00:44:18.614
I don't flirt…

565
00:44:18.697 --> 00:44:20.032
I didn't say anything.

566
00:44:21.742 --> 00:44:22.951
Why are you looking like that?

567
00:44:25.496 --> 00:44:26.413
You…

568
00:44:28.207 --> 00:44:30.793
reminded me of someone who said the same thing.

569
00:44:59.363 --> 00:45:01.031
There is plenty of room here.

570
00:45:01.115 --> 00:45:03.117
It's scary to sit alone.

571
00:45:03.784 --> 00:45:04.952
I'm talking about myself.

572
00:45:05.786 --> 00:45:07.788
Of course.

573
00:45:08.706 --> 00:45:10.040
I will sleep

574
00:45:33.147 --> 00:45:35.441
DAD

575
00:45:37.234 --> 00:45:38.152
What?

576
00:45:49.455 --> 00:45:50.456
Did you dream something?

577
00:45:52.291 --> 00:45:53.292
No.

578
00:45:54.418 --> 00:45:55.335
you cried

579
00:45:57.379 --> 00:46:00.424
It's hot here. I must have been sweating.

580
00:46:02.134 --> 00:46:03.093
And took my hand.

581
00:46:03.969 --> 00:46:06.513
Oh... I'm sorry.

582
00:46:07.723 --> 00:46:08.640
I accidentally

583
00:46:14.938 --> 00:46:15.856
OK.

584
00:46:42.257 --> 00:46:43.842
{\an8}WE FILM "WEALTH AND PROSPERITY"

585
00:46:43.926 --> 00:46:44.802
{\an8}Mr.

586
00:46:44.885 --> 00:46:49.306
{\an8}Mr. Kim of Geon Media
will take you for a short interview.

587
00:46:49.890 --> 00:46:51.892
This is your first film in a long time.

588
00:46:51.975 --> 00:46:54.102
and today is our last day.

589
00:46:54.186 --> 00:46:56.146
On-site interview? Why?

590
00:46:59.316 --> 00:47:03.028
I'm always sad on the last day
and during the closing party.

591
00:47:03.737 --> 00:47:05.697
This very word depresses.

592
00:47:05.781 --> 00:47:08.075
"Final" means it's the end.

593
00:47:08.700 --> 00:47:11.495
I worry about my career
is coming to an end.

594
00:47:11.578 --> 00:47:12.955
Goem, what do you say?

595
00:47:13.997 --> 00:47:14.998
A minute

596
00:47:19.920 --> 00:47:22.214
- Get ready. Let's start.
- Yes, sir.

597
00:47:24.883 --> 00:47:26.677
Sorry. That's you, isn't it?

598
00:47:28.053 --> 00:47:28.887
who are you

599
00:47:28.971 --> 00:47:32.850
I'm Kim Sang Guk from Geon Media.
You don't remember me?

600
00:47:34.059 --> 00:47:35.936
You are the daughter of Mr. Kim Hong Tong.

601
00:47:36.520 --> 00:47:39.439
you studied at school then
so I wasn't sure.

602
00:47:39.940 --> 00:47:42.109
But I see you haven't changed.

603
00:47:43.235 --> 00:47:46.488
Do you work on set?

604
00:47:47.531 --> 00:47:51.159
Do you want to fulfill your father's dream?

605
00:47:53.537 --> 00:47:54.955
How wonderful.

606
00:47:55.038 --> 00:47:56.290
Nothing of the kind.

607
00:47:56.790 --> 00:47:58.792
Remember your name.

608
00:47:58.876 --> 00:48:00.419
This is unusual.

609
00:48:01.003 --> 00:48:02.462
Of course. Mubi!

610
00:48:02.546 --> 00:48:05.632
When I first saw
your name i thought

611
00:48:05.716 --> 00:48:08.385
"Mr. Kim devoted his life to the art of cinema."

612
00:48:08.468 --> 00:48:09.303
A minute

613
00:48:09.386 --> 00:48:11.346
So, a man's daughter

614
00:48:11.430 --> 00:48:15.350
who died prematurely, leaves
the same way to make his dream come true.

615
00:48:15.434 --> 00:48:17.394
It will be a good article.

616
00:48:17.477 --> 00:48:21.815
nothing like that
please stop making it up.

617
00:48:28.822 --> 00:48:30.657
I wouldn't say so!

618
00:48:30.741 --> 00:48:32.576
But I understood you.

619
00:48:33.118 --> 00:48:35.120
I was glad to see you. See you soon.

620
00:48:39.833 --> 00:48:40.667
Come on.

621
00:48:58.185 --> 00:49:00.187
VIDE BAR

622
00:49:13.575 --> 00:49:15.327
I will wash and leave.

623
00:49:15.410 --> 00:49:17.204
Well, of course.

624
00:49:17.913 --> 00:49:20.248
Can you find a bar owner somewhere?

625
00:49:20.332 --> 00:49:22.834
who dismisses the employee before eight o'clock?

626
00:49:23.710 --> 00:49:24.795
Yes, here he is.

627
00:49:26.046 --> 00:49:29.341
But it's only today, okay?
What did you say there?

628
00:49:29.424 --> 00:49:31.343
- Seventh anniversary.
- Of course!

629
00:49:31.426 --> 00:49:34.888
That's why I'm letting you go.
Why are you in such a hurry?

630
00:49:34.972 --> 00:49:37.140
You need to buy something before the shops close.

631
00:49:37.724 --> 00:49:39.309
- Faster.
- Okay, go.

632
00:49:39.393 --> 00:49:41.061
- Faster!
- Good!

633
00:49:43.939 --> 00:49:45.357
- I'm already running.
- Huh.

634
00:49:45.440 --> 00:49:47.192
- Don't forget to lock it, boss.
- Okay.

635
00:49:47.275 --> 00:49:50.612
What a loser! So now I'm the boss?

636
00:49:56.326 --> 00:49:58.078
Yes, I'm leaving.

637
00:50:00.247 --> 00:50:02.541
See you in the studio. OK.

638
00:50:11.091 --> 00:50:12.134
Good.

639
00:50:13.218 --> 00:50:15.971
- Let's be!
- Let's be!

640
00:50:17.347 --> 00:50:20.350
You are all well done!

641
00:50:22.436 --> 00:50:25.022
Closing parties

642
00:50:26.690 --> 00:50:27.941
so sad!

643
00:50:30.193 --> 00:50:32.696
Sir, your nose is running.

644
00:50:36.867 --> 00:50:40.203
Goem, I need your honest opinion.

645
00:50:40.912 --> 00:50:44.666
How do you like my work?
I know you have a sharp eye.

646
00:50:45.250 --> 00:50:47.753
My honest opinion will hurt you again.

647
00:50:47.836 --> 00:50:49.921
Are you saying it's that bad?

648
00:50:50.005 --> 00:50:51.048
No, it's not…

649
00:50:51.590 --> 00:50:52.799
You have already caused pain.

650
00:50:53.967 --> 00:50:54.801
Song Tae!

651
00:50:54.885 --> 00:50:57.471
Sir, everything is fine!

652
00:50:59.347 --> 00:51:01.892
Enough shedding tears!

653
00:51:02.559 --> 00:51:04.561
Movies fail. Not scary.

654
00:51:05.228 --> 00:51:06.480
Damn fool!

655
00:51:32.714 --> 00:51:35.342
I thought you'd be the first to run away from the party.

656
00:51:35.425 --> 00:51:36.927
Why are you still here?

657
00:51:37.010 --> 00:51:40.430
You love parties more than anyone,
so why are you here

658
00:51:40.514 --> 00:51:42.099
You said

659
00:51:43.683 --> 00:51:46.019
what do you ask for when you need help?

660
00:51:46.103 --> 00:51:49.231
I have to be there
to hear you ask.

661
00:51:57.948 --> 00:52:01.993
You told me not to talk to you
but you smile at me

662
00:52:02.577 --> 00:52:06.706
Because I don't like talking to people

663
00:52:07.582 --> 00:52:08.917
or get closer

664
00:52:10.293 --> 00:52:11.336
Why?

665
00:52:12.212 --> 00:52:16.633
Because sooner or later they will leave.

666
00:52:17.634 --> 00:52:20.262
Isn't it hard to be so negative all the time?

667
00:52:20.345 --> 00:52:23.348
Isn't it hard to be so positive all the time?

668
00:52:26.601 --> 00:52:29.813
I don't trust people
who are constantly satisfied.

669
00:52:30.647 --> 00:52:33.316
They always go first.

670
00:52:34.776 --> 00:52:37.821
<i>I'm strangely attracted to Kim Mubi.</i>

671
00:52:39.865 --> 00:52:41.575
<i>And I think I understood why.</i>

672
00:52:51.543 --> 00:52:52.419
If…

673
00:52:56.256 --> 00:52:58.133
I will share with you a secret…

674
00:53:01.386 --> 00:53:03.013
will you like me

675
00:53:08.226 --> 00:53:09.477
Won't you leave me?

676
00:54:13.917 --> 00:54:14.876
This too

677
00:54:16.169 --> 00:54:17.254
by chance?

678
00:54:22.008 --> 00:54:22.842
No.

679
00:54:32.102 --> 00:54:32.936
Good.

680
00:54:41.653 --> 00:54:47.117
<i>Maybe she has a difficult period, like me.</i>

681
00:55:03.925 --> 00:55:05.260
what did you say

682
00:55:06.594 --> 00:55:07.554
i think

683
00:55:08.221 --> 00:55:09.347
we should go our separate ways.

684
00:55:44.341 --> 00:55:49.012
<i>This is how the dark night passed,</i>
<i>and dawn came.</i>

685
00:55:52.766 --> 00:55:55.769
<i>And then Ko Gyum disappeared.</i>

686
00:55:59.856 --> 00:56:04.944
LIKE IN THE MOVIE

687
00:58:24.167 --> 00:58:26.961
Translation of subtitles: Natalya Kovalyshyn

